file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the lifted say_the_word, taking the rung as a comptime type parameter and reaching all seventeen contract symbols through it
file caravan/abate.rye one of nineteen rungs whose forty-six-line body became a three-line call
file caravan/avow.rye read and left whole -- the rung whose report is the avow report keeps its own body
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the ceiling down to 79,686, the body figures resynced, and both the fold-queue and GREEN narrations rewritten for this lap
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the ceiling default moved with the assert that reads it
file crux/REMEMBER.md the Now refilled with this lap and the next crux named
recommend keep-going the queue's next head by realized fall is meet_the_debt at seventeen rungs by fifty lines over a one-line signature, about 752 -- check its contract symbols public first, since four laps running have now found the signature to weigh as heavily as the family. renew_path follows at thirty-one by twenty-seven (about 720) and would be the first fold in seven to widen, standing private in all thirty-one; weigh that before taking it. Then lost_published at forty by twenty, ask_path at thirty-one by twenty-five, bearing_published at thirty-nine by twenty. Beside them the booked reader_path merge would fold hand_path and tell_path into one body taking suffix and companion as comptime parameters; that is its own round across sixty-three rungs. The machine half of the address space stays owed, and the libsel4 generator gate (jinja2, ply) is still Keaton's word.
